      "name": "@wtt/dsh-creation-workbench",
      "title": {
        "zh": "WTT 创作工作台",
        "en": "WTT Creation Workbench"
      },
      "description": {
        "zh": "一块神奇的无限画布，你能够在这上面通过卡片的方式连接任意的流程，包括制作 PPT、制作视频以及文案创作。每个卡片可以独立设置 AI 模型，还可以通过内置的 super agent 小瓦，一句话创建连续工作流卡片来完成任务。",
        "en": "An infinite canvas where you can connect cards to build your own workflow for making slide decks, producing videos, or writing copy. Choose an AI model for each card, or tell Xiaowa, the built-in super agent, what you want in a single sentence and it will create a series of connected cards to get it done."
      },
