    {
      "name": "@wtt/dsh-wanalysis",
      "title": {
        "zh": "WTT 股票分析",
        "en": "WTT Stock Analysis"
      },
      "description": {
        "zh": "不用写代码，也能把自己的股票看盘想法、选股策略做成指标。比如告诉 AI「帮我标出 20 日均线上穿 60 日均线的日子」，就能在 A 股历史走势图上看看信号出现在哪天、后来股价怎么走。自带筹码集中度指标，下载过的行情断网也能看。",
        "en": "Turn your chart-reading ideas and stock-screening strategies into indicators without writing code. Ask AI to mark the days when the 20-day moving average crossed above the 60-day average, then see the signals on a historical A-share chart and how the price moved afterward. A chip concentration indicator is included, and downloaded charts are available offline."
      },
      "author": "Wattter (WTT)",
      "homepage": "https://github.com/WaterDJiang/wtt-dsh-plugin/tree/main/plugins/dsh-wanalysis",
      "repository": {
        "url": "https://github.com/WaterDJiang/wtt-dsh-plugin",
        "directory": "plugins/dsh-wanalysis"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "category": "finance",
        "keywords": [
          "WTT",
          "股票分析",
          "A股",
          "SQLite",
          "筹码集中度",
          "stock"
        ],
        "labels": [],
        "sortKeys": {}
      },
      "versions": [
        {
          "version": "0.5.3",
          "publishTimestamp": 1795704191,
          "source": {
